{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TEM18DM Diesel Shunting Locomotive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC adds a highly detailed model of the TEM18DM diesel locomotive to ZDSimulator \u2014 one of the most widely used shunting and light freight locomotives across the post-Soviet region. Designed for non-electrified yards and industrial railways, it offers powerful diesel traction and realistic control experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfed History</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The TEM18DM is a modernized version of the TEM18 series, developed by the Bryansk Machine-Building Plant (BMZ). Serial production began in 2008. The locomotive is designed for heavy shunting duties and hauling freight trains at sorting yards and industrial hubs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2699\ufe0f Technical Specifications</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Traction type:</strong> Diesel-electric</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wheel arrangement:</strong> Bo-Bo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engine power:</strong> 1200 kW (1630 hp)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Maximum speed:</strong> 100 km/h</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Locomotive weight:</strong> ~126 tons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Starting tractive effort:</strong> up to 346 kN</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Transmission:</strong> Electric</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Power unit:</strong> Turbocharged diesel engine</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae DLC Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-quality external model and driver\u2019s cab</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated control elements in the cab</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic engine, compressor, and relay sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic acceleration, braking, and inertia physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compatible with freight scenarios in ZDSimulator</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udea9 Operational Use</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TEM18DM is widely used on non-electrified sorting stations, industrial railway networks, factory spurs, and light freight lines without overhead power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Operated in Russia, Kazakhstan, Belarus, and occasionally in Ukraine \u2014 primarily at industrial sites.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614800?t=1744917851","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614800/cc3ba6150885120c9365ff1832f438da218ee0b6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744917851","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614800/e4ef24f4f5c7bf2059b71a4668fd3998f3d7ab3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744917851","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614800/e4ef24f4f5c7bf2059b71a4668fd3998f3d7ab3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744917851","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TEM18DM Diesel Shunting Locomotive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC adds a highly detailed model of the TEM18DM diesel locomotive to ZDSimulator \u2014 one of the most widely used shunting and light freight locomotives across the post-Soviet region. Designed for non-electrified yards and industrial railways, it offers powerful diesel traction and realistic control experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfed History</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The TEM18DM is a modernized version of the TEM18 series, developed by the Bryansk Machine-Building Plant (BMZ). Serial production began in 2008. The locomotive is designed for heavy shunting duties and hauling freight trains at sorting yards and industrial hubs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2699\